sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Sch as Planificateur / Admin
    participant Node as Serveur Node.js
    participant Edge as Edge Function Supabase
    participant JdcApi as Serveur API JDC
    participant DB as Base SQLite

    Sch->>Node: Déclenche un cycle (boot / cron / admin)
    Node->>Node: Vérifie le verrou
    Node->>Edge: GET public-products
    Edge->>JdcApi: Récupère le catalogue caisse
    JdcApi-->>Edge: Produits JDC
    Edge-->>Node: JSON products
    Node->>Node: Filtre isJdcSyncProduct
    Node->>DB: Lit les mappings
    alt Aucun mapping JDC vers site jdc
        Node-->>Sch: Sauté no_category_mappings
    else Mapping valide
        Node->>DB: Transaction applyJdcCatalogSync
        Node-->>Sch: Compte rendu
    end
